@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:HypothesisUpdate a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Hypothesis Update"; skos:definition "A state-changing update to a hypothesis justified by new observed evidence." .